## 3. Typography System

**Primary font:** Inter (Google Fonts), weights 400, 500, 600, 700. Loaded in `index.html` via `https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap`.

**Fallback stack:** `'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif` (globals.css body, tailwind.config fontFamily.sans).

**Headings:**
- h1–h6: font-weight 600, line-height 1.2 (globals.css)
- Landing h1: `clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem)`, font-weight 700
- Section h2: `clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem)` or `clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem)` for Portfolio, font-weight 700
- Stat card h3: 18px, font-weight 600

**Body:**
- p: line-height 1.6, font-weight 400
- Subheading: `clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem)`, font-weight 400
- Section descriptions: 1.125rem, opacity 0.7–0.8
- Stat items: 14px, font-weight 400
- Form labels: 14px, font-weight 600
- Form inputs: 16px

**Letter spacing:**
- Scroll indicator label: 1px, text-transform uppercase

**Text hierarchy:**
- Landing: Large h1, smaller subheading
- Sections: Centered h2, descriptive p
- Stat cards: Gradient h3, list items below
- Contact: Centered h2, form labels in aurora-green

**Where applied:**
- Body: globals.css
- Landing: inline styles in `src/sections/Landing.jsx`
- About: inline styles in `src/sections/About.jsx`
- Portfolio: inline styles in `src/sections/Portfolio.jsx`
- Contact: inline styles in `src/sections/Contact.jsx`
- AboutStats: inline styles in `src/components/AboutStats.jsx`
- Cube: 14px, font-weight 600 for project names

